# Flow Architecture

- Inspect before modifying. Read relevant `.codex/skills/flow-*/SKILL.md` before architectural work.
- Respect module boundaries: commercial, database, api, web, experience layers stay separate.
- Never bypass the Action Wall for approvals or side effects.
- Never expose cross-tenant data. Every tenant table needs `workspace_id` and RLS.
- Workspace-scoped API routes: `/api/v1/workspaces/:workspaceId/...`
- LLMs never perform authoritative monetary calculations — use `@flow/commercial` deterministic functions.
- Northstar demo data stays isolated from authenticated workspaces (sessionStorage, no live DB writes).
- Prefer extending existing patterns over new abstractions.
